menu "Radios"

config RADIO_CYW43
    bool "CYW43439 radio (Pico W Wi-Fi and Bluetooth)"
    default y if BOARD_PICO2_W
    help
      Links pico_cyw43_arch_lwip_poll and the USB-servicing wrap of
      cyw43_await_background_or_timeout_us. NET_WIFI and BT_LE on the Pico
      use this chip. A later target leaves it off. Current Pico images
      keep it.

config IEEE802154
    bool "802.15.4 MAC"
    default n
    help
      The 802.15.4 MAC. On the ESP32-C5 this is the built-in radio. There
      is no RP2350 driver. Specified and not built. Turning this on fails
      configure.

config NET_THREAD
    bool "Thread over 802.15.4"
    default n
    depends on IEEE802154
    help
      Thread on the 802.15.4 MAC. Specified and not built. Turning this
      on fails configure.

endmenu
